# Issue #2697 proposal 18 (greenfield flag day): registration keys and the
# login signature travel as canonical padded base64 instead of JSON number
# arrays. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new
# contract.
POST /auth/register the `encapsulationPublicKey` request property's maxLength was set to `2092`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register the `signingPublicKey` request property's maxLength was set to `3456`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register the `encapsulationPublicKey` request property's minLength was set to `2092`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register the `signingPublicKey` request property's minLength was set to `3456`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register added the pattern `^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4}){522}[A-Za-z0-9+/]{2}[AEIMQUYcgkosw048]=$` to the request property `encapsulationPublicKey`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register added the pattern `^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4}){864}$` to the request property `signingPublicKey`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register the `encapsulationPublicKey` request property `type` changed from `array<integer>` to `string`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/register the `signingPublicKey` request property `type` changed from `array<integer>` to `string`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/verify the `signature` request property's maxLength was set to `6172`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/verify the `signature` request property's minLength was set to `6172`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/verify added the pattern `^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4}){1542}[A-Za-z0-9+/][AQgw]==$` to the request property `signature`

# Issue #2697 proposal 18: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /auth/verify the `signature` request property `type` changed from `array<integer>` to `string`

